 verdadeiros campeões nos tatames do Brasil e do mundo. O legado deixado pela família Gracie e perpetuado por seus pupilos - que aprenderam os golpes ensinados por seus mestres - e atualmente são grandes nomes do universo da arte suave. O programa de hoje está histórico!" type="episode" contentRating="A12" duration="1882000" grandparentArt="https://images.frequency.com/video/7457057344502162244/solid/rectangle/w1920_h1080/pksy6t8ioltp1ghbqazpsxb0w.jpg" grandparentGuid="plex://show/6a2ff384a07b9cdd336fc56e" grandparentKey="/library/metadata/6a2ff384a07b9cdd336fc56e" grandparentRatingKey="6a2ff384a07b9cdd336fc56e" grandparentThumb="https://images.frequency.com/video/originals/7457057344502162244/Texted/rectangle/1ptm57b4sbcos17wvv19q7j3lc.png" grandparentTitle="NA ESTRADA DO JIU-JITSU - T1 E3" grandparentType="show" hasGenericTitle="1" index="1" originallyAvailableAt="2026-05-04T13:39:33Z" parentIndex="1" requiresConsent="1" skipParent="1" thumb="https://images.frequency.com/video/7457057344502162244/solid/rectangle/w1920_h1080/pksy6t8ioltp1ghbqazpsxb0w.jpg" title="Episode 1" userState="0" year="2026"><Image alt="Episode 1" type="coverArt" url="https://images.frequency.com/video/7457057344502162244/solid/rectangle/w1920_h1080/pksy6t8ioltp1ghbqazpsxb0w.jpg"/><Image alt="Episode 1" type="coverPoster" url="https://images.frequency.com/video/originals/7457057344502162244/Texted/rectangle/1ptm57b4sbcos17wvv19q7j3lc.png"/><Image alt="Episode 1" type="snapshot" url="https://images.frequency.com/video/7457057344502162244/solid/rectangle/w1920_h1080/pksy6t8ioltp1ghbqazpsxb0w.jpg"/><Genre filter="genre=620143f98578b9238e1cdb8a" id="620143f98578b9238e1cdb8a" key="/library/sections/home/all?genre=620143f98578b9238e1cdb8a" ratingKey="genre_620143f98578b9238e1cdb8a" slug="sports" tag="Sports" type="directory" context="tag.genre"/><Media beginsAt="1782742501" duration="1882000" endsAt="1782744383" id="6a3143e84537e7b3233033f5" onAir="0" premiere="0" videoResolution="720" origin="livetv"/></Video><Video guid="plex://episode/6a2ff390a07b9cdd336fc5da" key="/library/metadata/6a2ff390a07b9cdd336fc5da" ratingKey="6a2ff390a07b9cdd336fc5da" summary="UFC 300: Pereira x Hill em 13 de abril de 2024, na T-Mobile Arena em Las Vegas, Nevada." type="episode" contentRating="A12" duration="18392000" grandparentArt="https://images.frequency.com/video/7454438614686890964/solid/rectangle/w1920_h1080/1as1qymfig50q1kj2n63mzx0p4.jpg" grandparentGuid="plex://show/6a2ff384a07b9cdd336fc56f" grandparentKey="/library/metadata/6a2ff384a07b9cdd336fc56f" grandparentRatingKey="6a2ff384a07b9cdd336fc56f" grandparentThumb="https://images.frequency.com/video/originals/7454438614686890964/Texted/rectangle/1husudedb3aaq1tp9denwvddya.png" grandparentTitle="UFC 300 (Luta a Luta)" grandparentType="show" hasGenericTitle="1" index="1" originallyAvailableAt="2026-04-27T08:03:37Z" parentIndex="1" requiresConsent="1" skipParent="1" thumb="https://images.frequency.com/video/7454438614686890964/solid/rectangle/w1920_h1080/1as1qymfig50q1kj2n63mzx0p4.jpg" title="Episode 1" userState="0" year="2026"><Image alt="Episode 1" type="coverArt" url="https://images.frequency.com/video/7454438614686890964/solid/rectangle/w1920_h1080/1as1qymfig50q1kj2n63mzx0p4.jpg"/><Image alt="Episode 1" type="coverPoster" url="https://images.frequency.com/video/originals/7454438614686890964/Texted/rectangle/1husudedb3aaq1tp9denwvddya.png"/><Image alt="Episode 1" type="snapshot" url="https://images.frequency.com/video/7454438614686890964/solid/rectangle/w1920_h1080/1as1qymfig50q1kj2n63mzx0p4.jpg"/><Genre filter="genre=620143f98578b9238e1cdb8a" id="620143f98578b9238e1cdb8a" key="/library/sections/home/all?genre=620143f98578b9238e1cdb8a" ratingKey="genre_620143f98578b9238e1cdb8a" slug="sports" tag="Sports" type="directory" context="tag.genre"/><Media beginsAt="1782744383" duration="18392000" endsAt="1782762775" id="6a3143e84537e7b3233033f6" onAir="0" premiere="0" videoResolution="720" origin="livetv"/></Video><Video guid="plex://episode/6a2ff390a07b9cdd336fc5dc" key="/library/metadata/6a2ff390a07b9cdd336fc5dc" ratingKey="6a2ff390a07b9cdd336fc5dc" summary="Uma nova luta passa a existir. Criada no Japão, mas adaptada em solo brasileiro pelos irmãos Gracie, o Jiu Jitsu agora precisa ser conhecido. Como ensinar uma luta que ninguém sabe exatamente qual é? Como diferenciar a arte suave do karatê, do boxe tailandês, da capoeira e do judô? A resposta encontrada pelos precursores do Jiu Jitsu foi o desafio. Os mestres e seus pupilos desafiavam toda a sorte de lutadores de outras modalidades, criando assim as famosas “tretas” e rivalidades históricas. Com técnicas simples e inesperadas que levavam seus oponente ao chão, os alunos da família Gracie venciam todos os desafios propostos, demonstrando a superioridade do Jiu Jitsu brasileiro. Pouco a pouco, o Jiu Jitsu vai conquistando corações e mentes ao redor do Brasil até consagrar-se como um dos esportes mais queridos do país." type="episode" contentRating="A12" duration="1934000" grandparentArt="https://images.frequency.com/video/7457081283049698957/solid/rectangle/w1920_h1080/8eqhkfs81wr31e375r808hnvs.jpg" grandparentGuid="plex://show/6a2ff384a07b9cdd336fc570" grandparentKey="/library/metadata/6a2ff384a07b9cdd336fc570" grandparentRatingKey="6a2ff384a07b9cdd336fc570" grandparentThumb="https://images.frequency.com/video/originals/7457081283049698957/Texted/rectangle/3zb1l62n6x1b1cgz35xbj6h4c.png" grandparentTitle="NA ESTRADA DO JIU JITSU - T1 E4" grandparentType="show" hasGenericTitle="1" index="1" originallyAvailableAt="2026-05-04T15:17:42Z" parentIndex="1" requiresConsent="1" skipParent="1" thumb="https://images.frequency.com/video/7457081283049698957/solid/rectangle/w1920_h1080/8eqhkfs81wr31e375r808hnvs.jpg" title="Episode 1" userState="0" year="2026"><Image alt="Episode 1" type="coverArt" url="https://images.frequency.com/video/7457081283049698957/solid/rectangle/w1920_h1080/8eqhkfs81wr31e375r808hnvs.jpg"/><Image alt="Episode 1" type="coverPoster" url="https://images.frequency.com/video/originals/7457081283049698957/Texted/rectangle/3zb1l62n6x1b1cgz35xbj6h4c.png"/><Image alt="Episode 1" type="snapshot" url="https://images.frequency.com/video/7457081283049698957/solid/rectangle/w1920_h1080/8eqhkfs81wr31e375r808hnvs.jpg"/><Genre filter="genre=620143f98578b9238e1cdb8a" id="620143f98578b9238e1cdb8a" key="/library/sections/home/all?genre=620143f98578b9238e1cdb8a" ratingKey="genre_620143f98578b9238e1cdb8a" slug="sports" tag="Sports" type="directory" context="tag.genre"/><Media beginsAt="1782762775" duration="1934000" endsAt="1782764709" id="6a3143e84537e7b3233033f7" onAir="0" premiere="0" videoResolution="720" origin="livetv"/></Video><Video guid="plex://episode/6a2ff390a07b9cdd336fc5de" key="/library/metadata/6a2ff390a07b9cdd336fc5de" ratingKey="6a2ff390a07b9cdd336fc5de" summary="Através deste episódio vamos conhecer como o Jiu Jitsu brasileiro foi conquistando território nos Estados Unidos. Rorion Gracie, responsável por esta expansão, vai contar em detalhes seus primeiros anos nos EUA, as dificuldades do início, os desafios de luta de garagem que vieram a ser os precursores de uma competição que tempos depois viria mobilizar milhões de dólares, golpes, espectadores e sangue o UFC. Já no subúrbio do Rio de Janeiro, vamos conversar com mestre Fadda, discípulo pouco conhecido de Matsuo Maeda, o Conde Koma. Na contramão da fama dos Gracie, Fadda leva uma vida de ensinamentos e luta bem longe dos holofotes." type="episode" contentRating="A12" duration="1900000" grandparentArt="https://images.frequency.com/video/7457051317984511707/solid/rectangle/w1920_h1080/10u1txv6uccur1mx6g2buyeax1.jpg" grandparentGuid="plex://show/6a2ff384a07b9cdd336fc571" grandparentKey="/library/metadata/6a2ff384a07b9cdd336fc571" grandparentRatingKey="6a2ff384a07b9cdd336fc571" grandparentThumb="https://images.frequency.com/video/originals/7457051317984511707/Texted/rectangle/tny17qr8xqsu1rcli4brt2tc9.png" grandparentTitle="NA ESTRADA DO JIU-JITSU - T1 E5" grandparentType="show" hasGenericTitle="1" index="1" originallyAvailableAt="2026-05-04T13:17:31Z" parentIndex="1" requiresConsent="1" skipParent="1" thumb="https://images.frequency.com/video/7457051317984511707/solid/rectangle/w1920_h1080/10u1txv6uccur1mx6g2buyeax1.jpg" title="Episode 1" userState="0" year="2026"><Image alt="Episode 1" type="coverArt" url="https://images.frequency.com/video/7457051317984511707/solid/rectangle/w1920_h1080/10u1txv6uccur1mx6g2buyeax1.jpg"/><Image alt="Episode 1" type="coverPoster" url="https://images.frequency.com/video/originals/7457051317984511707/Texted/rectangle/tny17qr8xqsu1rcli4brt2tc9.png"/><Image alt="Episode 1" type="snapshot" url="https://images.frequency.com/video/7457051317984511707/solid/rectangle/w1920_h1080/10u1txv6uccur1mx6g2buyeax1.jpg"/><Genre filter="genre=620143f98578b9238e1cdb8a" id="620143f98578b9238e1cdb8a" key="/library/sections/home/all?genre=620143f98578b9238e1cdb8a" ratingKey="genre_620143f98578b9238e1cdb8a" slug="sports" tag="Sports" type="directory" context="tag.genre"/><Media beginsAt="1782764709" duration="1900000" endsAt="1782766609" id="6a3143e84537e7b3233033f8" onAir="0" premiere="0" videoResolution="720" origin="livetv"/></Video><Video guid="plex://episode/6a2ff391a07b9cdd336fc5e0" key="/library/metadata/6a2ff391a07b9cdd336fc5e0" ratingKey="6a2ff391a07b9cdd336fc5e0" summary="Após ser conhecido e legitimado por atletas de diferentes modalidades, o Jiu Jitsu precisava de grana! Os pioneiros do esporte nos EUA precisaram buscar patrocínios que pudessem viabilizar os combates, pagar os lutadores e as competições. É assim que surgem os primeiros investidores, os primeiros negócios, as primeiras perdas e os primeiros lucros. Longe de ser um esporte mercenário, vamos conhecer também o encontro da arte suave com a yoga, através do atleta Saulo Ribeiro, que, apesar de viver nos Estados Unidos, é mais um legítimo representante do Jiu Jitsu manauara e do espírito de luta contido no DNA caboclo.  Oss! Opa, quer dizer… Namastê!" type="episode" contentRating="A12" duration="1925000" grandparentArt="https://images.frequency.com/video/7457074485266106209/solid/rectangle/w1920_h1080/1v0l4q2b6si4a1vygnpfnf7n9k.jpg" grandparentGuid="plex://show/6a2ff384a07b9cdd336fc572" grandparentKey="/library/metadata/6a2ff384a07b9cdd336fc572" grandparentRatingKey="6a2ff384a07b9cdd336fc572" grandparentThumb="https://images.frequency.com/video/originals/7457074485266106209/Texted/rectangle/q5d4gwiw9wun1rx3s8f9vsz0y.png" grandparentTitle="NA ESTRADA DO JIU-JITSU - T1 E6" grandparentType="show" hasGenericTitle="1" index="1" originallyAvailableAt="2026-05-04T14:43:40Z" parentIndex="1" requiresConsent="1" skipParent="1" thumb="https://images.frequency.com/video/7457074485266106209/solid/rectangle/w1920_h1080/1v0l4q2b6si4a1vygnpfnf7n9k.jpg" title="Episode 1" userState="0" year="2026"><Image alt="Episode 1" type="coverArt" url="https://images.frequency.com/video/7457074485266106209/solid/rectangle/w1920_h1080/1v0l4q2b6si4a1vygnpfnf7n9k.jpg"/><Image alt="Episode 1" type="coverPoster" url="https://images.frequency.com/video/originals/7457074485266106209/Texted/rectangle/q5d4gwiw9wun1rx3s8f9vsz0y.png"/><Image alt="Episode 1" type="snapshot" url="https://images.frequency.com/video/7457074485266106209/solid/rectangle/w1920_h1080/1v0l4q2b6si4a1vygnpfnf7n9k.jpg"/><Genre filter="genre=620143f98578b9238e1cdb8a" id="620143f98578b9238e1cdb8a" key="/library/sections/home/all?genre=620143f98578b9238e1cdb8a" ratingKey="genre_620143f98578b9238e1cdb8a" slug="sports" tag="Sports" type="directory" context="tag.genre"/><Media beginsAt="1782766609" duration="1925000" endsAt="1782768534" id="6a3143e84537e7b3233033f9" onAir="0" premiere="0" videoResolution="720" origin="livetv"/></Video><Video guid="plex://episode/6a3143e64537e7b32330331c" key="/library/metadata/6a3143e64537e7b32330331c" ratingKey="6a3143e64537e7b32330331c" summary="Apenas uma luta resta para o Time McGregor tentar evitar a maior gole